{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:01.12]Every time me and slime get together it's a wave, slatt\n[00:05.84](Tank God)\n[Chorus: Young Thug & Juice WRLD]\n[00:06.10]Road to redemption, babygirl, I will follow (I will follow)\n[00:09.02]You can be my baby and my dick can be your bottle (Dick can be your bottle)\n[00:13.42]She got magic how she catch it and she swallow (And she swallow)\n[00:15.78]Ferragamo body, watch for your bubble (Your bubble, oh)\n[00:18.72]I hope you never change on me for clout (For clout, no)\n[00:21.94]I hope you never look at me in doubt (In doubt, no)\n[00:25.14]I heard you single, what is they talkin' 'bout? (Talkin' 'bout, oh)\n[00:28.40]You gonna end up on the sunny south (South, oh), yeah\n[Verse 1: Young Thug & Juice WRLD]\n[00:32.44]Lookin' at the phone, waitin' for your call, I'm thinkin' 'bout you (I'm thinkin' 'bout you)\n[00:35.58]Break the street code, I don't give a damn, I'll rat about you, yeah (Yeah, I'll rat about you)\n[00:38.92]I can't put it into words, I'd be sad without you, baby (I'd be sad without you)\n[00:42.18]No appetite, no busy bees, no Applebees, baby (No Applebees, baby)\n[00:45.48]Only thing that'd be equal to you is yo' twin, baby (Yo' twin, baby)\n[00:47.52]I dropped out of books and got no win in it (No win in it)\n[00:51.82]I wrote all my shit without no pen, get it (No pen, get it)\n[00:55.00]Meet me with your friends, help me enjoy your city (Enjoy your city)\n[01:01.08]All of your bitches wan' be my friend (Wan' be my friend)\n[01:04.08]If you wan' know why she suckin' dick (Why she suckin' dick)\n[01:07.00]Probably how niggas are leakin' it (Lickin' it)\n[01:08.38]Rolex diamonds and a new AP (Clean)\n[01:10.34]Ran up a check without wearing Nikes (Ran up a check without)\n[01:13.38]I know your woman wanna be my queen (I know your woman wanna)\n[01:16.72]I know your address, so shit can flip (Stick and flip, grrt)\n[01:19.66]I don't get reception, no, yeah, yeah (Yeah)\n[01:21.58]Smart as I slime (Smart as I slime)\n[01:23.44]All these coins on ice, tonight (On ice)\n[01:28.20]Let me text her line, your life's line (Your life's line)\n[01:32.06]Leadin' the blind (I'm leadin' the blind)\n[01:36.06]Baby, I got you on\n[01:38.30]Ninety percent of 'em bad to the bone (To the bone)\n[01:40.84]I bought this bitch some Rihanna stones (\n[01:43.40]Stones\n[01:43.78])\n[01:44.60]Now she know why the weather's changed to storm (It's changed to storm)\n[01:47.80]You play hockey on my wrist (My wrist, my wrist, my wrist)\n[01:50.96]It ain't no hidin' both my wrists (Ice up off my wrist, off my wrist), You should try this\n[01:55.86]I got persuasion, I can tell you not my bitch\n[01:58.16]I got old ladies dreamin' 'bout bein' with me, bitch\n[02:01.78]You should try this (You can try this)\n[02:07.98]You should try this (On God)\n[02:08.66]Drink my spit, freaky bitch (On God)\n[02:11.30]You can tell me if you ain't on this shit (If you ain't on this shit)\n[02:13.40]I get 'em hit (I get 'em hit)\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[02:13.96]You can play hockey on my wrists (On my wrists)\n[02:16.06]AP shit, it's gon' shine, it's gon' glist (It's gon' glist)\n[02:18.54]Yo' diamonds like piss, yeah\n[02:20.26]Good personality, but bitch, you bad (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[02:23.26]If you leave me, then I'm gon' be sad (Gon' be sad)\n[02:26.42]I first met you like three years ago (Three years ago)\n[02:29.62]I saw your face in this dream I had (Dream I had)\n[02:32.98]Then I woke up layin' next to the ho I smashed (Ya' dig?)\n[02:36.38]It wasn't you, so it made me mad (Huh)\n[02:39.42]AP my wrist, Gucci my bitch\n[02:41.02]YSL clique, it's me and slime\n[02:42.86]150 shit, No Limit shit\n[02:44.06]That's the gang, I'm gon' ride\n[02:45.82]If you try me or my crew, yeah, he gon' die\n[02:48.78]This nina clean, totin' that thing, thirty clip in a forty-five (Yeah)\n[02:51.88]Extended clip, don't try it (Don't try it)\n[02:55.02]Hear that click-clack, then them bullets flyin'\n[02:57.98]When you're in my presence, acknowledge it\n[03:01.44]I got these millions just to see my momma rich (My momma)\n[03:03.66]Ladders I climb (Ladders I climb)\n[03:05.66]I'm talkin' about the ladders to life (To life)\n[03:09.92]I'm goin' to the top, where I shine (Where I shine)\n[03:12.92]Feel like Tony Hawk, on my grind (On my grind), ya dig?\n[03:17.18]Thugger be my clique (Bang), try me, you get sent up (Yeah)\n[03:20.38]Gang totin' them sticks (Slimes), we'll send this shit up (Grrah)\n[03:23.60]That's on my life, my life (My life)\n[03:25.92]I may just buy my momma a car tonight, I'm rich (I love you momma)\n[Chorus: Young Thug & Juice WRLD]\n[03:29.22]Road to redemptions, babygirl, I will follow (I will follow)\n[03:32.24]You can be my baby and my dick can be your bottle (And it can be your bottle)\n[03:35.66]She got magic how she catch it and she swallow (And, yeah)\n[03:39.16]Ferragamo body, watch for your bubble (Your bubble, oh)\n[03:42.06]I hope you never change on me for clout (Oh)\n[03:45.40]I hope you never look at me in doubt (Yeah, yeah)\n[03:49.24]I heard you single, what is they talkin' 'bout? (Single, let me know)\n[03:54.92]You gonna end up on the sunny south (Yeah, for sure), yeah","words":[[1.12,1.22,"Every"],[1.32,1.54,"time"],[1.64,1.7,"me"],[1.8,1.86,"and"],[1.92,2.14,"slime"],[2.3,2.4,"get"],[2.44,2.74,"together"],[2.78,3.0,"it's"],[3.1,3.1,"a"],[3.24,4.34,"wave,"],[4.74,5.8,"slatt"],[5.84,5.94,"(Tank"],[6.0,6.06,"God)"],[6.1,6.2,"Road"],[6.26,6.28,"to"],[6.32,6.8,"redemption,"],[6.88,7.18,"babygirl,"],[7.32,7.32,"I"],[7.36,7.48,"will"],[7.52,7.78,"follow"],[7.86,7.86,"(I"],[7.92,8.0,"will"],[8.04,8.34,"follow)"],[9.02,9.1,"You"],[9.14,9.2,"can"],[9.24,9.32,"be"],[9.42,9.52,"my"],[9.62,9.88,"baby"],[9.92,10.0,"and"],[10.22,10.26,"my"],[10.42,10.56,"dick"],[10.62,10.74,"can"],[10.8,10.86,"be"],[10.96,11.16,"your"],[11.22,12.32,"bottle"],[12.48,12.62,"(Dick"],[12.66,12.7,"can"],[12.84,12.92,"be"],[13.08,13.16,"your"],[13.2,13.36,"bottle)"],[13.42,13.46